// Pixel Icon Library (HackerNoon), 24px grid — the same pixel logic as Departure
// Mono, which is why this set sits inside the brand instead of on top of it.
// Geometry is inlined rather than fetched so the marks take `currentColor` and
// follow the ink/blue rules like any other glyph. Source icons ship with no fill
// attribute, so they would default to black; fill is set on the <svg> here.
//
// Licence: the npm package ships MIT (Copyright 2023 HackerNoon) while the
// website states CC BY 4.0. MIT is the more permissive reading and is what the
// distributed artefact carries. Attribution is retained in this comment either
// way; see the note in the lab page before shipping to production.
